7:13:13 PM [express] GET /api/profiles/me 304 in 10ms :: {"id":6,"userId":"50036542","displayName":"Priviledge","bio":"**About Me**\n\nI lead a life fueled by both intellectual curiosity and deep faith. Currently, I’m balancing the worlds of medicine and education—working as a temporary teacher while studying medicine and exploring a passion for building AI technology. When I’m not immersed in academic discussions or shaping young minds, you can usually find me grounding myself at church. I value integrity above all else and believe that a life well-lived is a healthy balance of seeking peace and embracing adventure.\n\nIn relationships, I prioritize harmony over noise. I believe in cooling down during conflicts so we can communicate calmly and truly hear one another. I am someone who loves with full presence—I show up through calls, messages, and a consistent effort to make my partner feel prioritized. Thoughtfulness is my love language; I always strive to consider how my words and actions impact the person I care about, and I value a connection where that consideration is mutual.\n\nI’m looking for a partner who is genuinely happy and comfortable in their own skin—someone who is fun, lovely, and truly down-to-earth. I value authenticity and realness over perfection. I’m hoping to find a man who is ready to put in equal effort, enjoy each other's company wholeheartedly, and build a relationship that feels safe, genuine, and undeniably real.","age":null,"gender":null,"location":"Harare","personalityProfile":{"0":"Integrity, peace,adventure ","1":"Most likely at church praying or in a discussion st university ","2":"Peace over noise in the hit of conflict then talk things over when everyone is calm","3":"Building AI technology both in academics and different areas of life, im a medical student also","4":"Taking into consideration what everything one says or do will affect the other half","5":"Cheating and expecting the partner to do everything ","6":"Everything present , call, message and try to live to their expectation","7":"I'm a temporary school teacher","8":"Someone who is genuinely happy and genuinely enjoys company of others, someone who is real and lovely genuinely and wholeheartedly,  someone fun but down to earth","9":"He isthe guy i dreamt of"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"profileVisibility":"public","coverPhotoUrl":"/uploads/1771783602724-926269227.jpg","cartoonPhotoUrl":null,"aboutMe":null,"aboutMeSource":"user","aboutMeUpdatedAt":null,"aboutSummary":"A medical student and AI enthusiast by day with a heart for teaching, I’m essentially building the future while staying grounded in my faith and love for adventure.","personalitySummary":"I lead with integrity and a 'peace-over-noise' mindset, offering a love that is felt through consistent presence, thoughtful consideration, and calm, honest communication.","isVerified":false,"profileCompletionScore":60,"superMatchesRemaining":0,"boostsRemaining":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:46:28.682Z"}
