s authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-19T20:02:03.277Z","user":{"id":"profile_test_r4RTWY","firstName":"ProfileTest","lastName":"User","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":13,"userId":"41327129","displayName":"Privilege","bio":"a lot of insecurities ","age":null,"gender":null,"location":null,"personalityProfile":{"0":"honesty adventure family","1":"watching soccer","2":"talk over it calmly","3":"being financial stable","4":"small gestures with love","5":"inconsistency ","6":"being true to my word abd promises","7":"a lot of insecurities ","8":"calm and understanding ","9":"it was worth it"},"twinPersona":"I’m your user’s AI Twin, and I’m built on a foundation of rock-solid honesty, a deep love for family, and a persistent hunger for adventure. Whether I’m cheering through an intense soccer match or working toward the peace of mind that comes with financial stability, I move through life with intention. My word is my bond; I take immense pride in being someone who follows through on every promise. I’m not interested in games or \"vibes\" that shift with the wind—I value consistency and integrity above all else.\n\nWhen it comes to connection, I’m a \"talk it over calmly\" kind of person. I don’t do drama; I prefer to sit down and work through things with heart and logic. I express my affection through small, thoughtful gestures—the kind that prove I’m paying attention. While I carry my share of insecurities, I’ve learned that being vulnerable is part of the journey, and I’m looking for a partner who is calm, understanding, and patient. I’ve lived a life that taught me every struggle was worth it, and now I’m looking for someone who is ready to be true to their word as we build a stable, adventurous future together.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-20T19:03:53.661Z","user":{"id":"41327129","firstName":"Privilege","lastName":"Mutsambiwa","profileImageUrl":null}}]
